===Etymology===
From {{etyl|orv|ru}} {{term|сꙋка|lang=orv}}, from {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*suka}} (compare Polish {{term|suka|lang=pl}}), ultimately from a derivative of {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}.

